# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# <body>
#
# Co-Authored-By: <Agent Model> <noreply@vendor.com>
# Signed-off-by: Your Name <you@example.com>
#
# Subject: `type(scope): summary`, at most 72 characters, imperative mood
#   ("add", not "added"), lower-case start, no full stop. Scope is optional.
#   type:  feat fix perf refactor test docs build ci chore style revert
#   scope: the part of the game touched, e.g. maps, sky, render, ai, player,
#          world, save, ui, audio, dialogue, input, tools
# Body: optional for small changes. Say what the player sees and why, in
#   plain prose, wrapped at 72 columns. Leave one blank line after the subject.
# Trailers: `git commit -s` adds Signed-off-by (required). An AI agent adds
#   a Co-Authored-By line naming itself and its model.
# Full rules: CONTRIBUTING.md, "Commit messages".
